  "source": {
    "origin": "reference_adaptation",
    "notes": "Reverse-engineered from the local White Weddings Theme reference video's full 390s / 39-page venue-loop (templates/Weddings/White Weddings Theme). Broadens white-weddings-editorial-01 with the loop's extra layout vocabulary — masonry grid wall, tinted spread, save-the-date card, polaroid feature, arch/gazebo breathers — added to layouts/library.json. Almost entirely layer_scene (flat Canva-style pages, matching what the reference actually does), plus one mask_reveal signature beat to satisfy the engine's advanced-effect requirement. Every page now names a `look` on the `page_round` frame preset (radius 24, no matte). That is a move TOWARD the reference, not away from it: the source pages have rounded photo corners and the original port could not express them, so it shipped square. Three of those looks also depart from a literal page-for-page reading, and each is a move TOWARD the reference's variety rather than away from it: the reference gives every page its own composition, while this adaptation had full_bleed_quote carrying the announcement, a second beat and the wordless fallback of four scenes at once."
  },
  "intro": {
    "summary": "Bộ sưu tập đầy đủ nhất của dòng White Weddings — nhiều 'trang' giai điệu ngà ấm, phù hợp video dài hơi.",
    "photos": "Hợp đa dạng loại ảnh: chân dung, chi tiết, nhóm, phong cảnh — bộ layout phong phú nhất trong các recipe white_weddings (20–55 ảnh).",
    "story": "Phù hợp khi muốn video save-the-date/prewedding dài, đầy đủ chi tiết hơn white-weddings-editorial-01, với nhiều 'trang' câu chuyện khác nhau.",
    "music": "Hợp nhạc acoustic nhẹ nhàng, thanh lịch, lãng mạn, tiết tấu chậm đến vừa."
  },
